"A world keeper is a huge reflective folded object, teleported ahead of spreading corruption."
"It preserves a small part of a region, and stores uncorrupted things."
"Restoration starts from it, since many magics need some part of nature to be as it should."
"One can expand to cover about four summonariums; worse chaos means less area kept."
"World keepers are not placed where they would break down quickly."
